  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring refreshing summer cocktails, tropical drinks, straw hats, sunglasses, beach bags, and floral accents.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom cocktail mugs, tropical tumblers, water bottles, and vacation-themed home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for apparel, boutique branding, and seasonal gift items.   Custom apparel creation for summer t-shirts, cozy vacation hoodies, canvas beach bag pouches, and custom everyday tote bags.   Summer-themed event decor, beach party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.",
